      "text": "Ferrer-Gallego P P, Navarro A, Pérez P, Roselló R, Rosselló J A, Rosato M, Laguna E, felipe (2015). A new polyploid species of Limonium (Plumbaginaceae) from the Western Mediterranean basin. Plazi.org taxonomic treatments database. Checklist dataset https://doi.org/10.15468/jrz84g accessed via GBIF.org on 2026-09-15.",
